frs=[('Optional due date and visible task date','B-002','D-0002','Allow task creation with or without an optional due date, assignment during editing, and clear display of the assigned calendar date in the task list.'),('Edit and clear with existing autosave','B-002, B-011','D-0002, D-0019','Allow changing or clearing an assigned due date through existing editing/autosave behavior. Cancel discards only unsaved or invalid drafts and never undoes already saved changes.'),('Calendar date eligibility and validation','B-007, B-008','D-0009, D-0017','Accept past, present and future valid calendar dates. Use the device local calendar without timezone-related shifts. Reject invalid calendar dates while preserving the last valid saved date; absence of a date is valid.'),('Overdue presentation without reordering','B-009','D-0016','For an unfinished task with a date before device-local today, show an explicit Overdue label and subtle warning styling. Today, future dates and undated tasks are not overdue. Preserve existing ordering.'),('Completion retains due dates','B-010','D-0018','Completing a task retains its date without overdue emphasis. Reopening restores overdue indication if the retained date is before device-local today.'),('Durability and CRUD compatibility','B-003, B-004','D-0003, D-0004','Persist assigned, changed and cleared dates across restarts. Preserve existing undated records and CRUD/completion behavior.'),('Consistent Littlelist experience','B-005','D-0005','Present date creation, editing, clearing, display and validation as an intuitive, visually polished part of the existing Littlelist experience.')]
for n,(title,b,d,s)in enumerate(frs,1):item('Functional requirements','fr',n,title,b,d,statement=s)
ucs=[('Create task with optional date','B-002, B-007, B-008, B-004, B-005','D-0002, D-0009, D-0017, D-0004, D-0005','FR-001, FR-003, FR-006, FR-007','Littlelist is running and the user is creating a task.','The user creates a task.','The user enters a valid task title and optionally selects a calendar date.','2. The application validates the date when supplied.\n  3. The application saves the task and shows its assigned date in the list.','Leaving the date empty is valid. A past date is valid. An impossible date is rejected without being saved; existing task validation remains intact.','The task and any selected date are available in the list and remain saved across restart.'),('Edit, validate or clear a due date','B-002, B-011, B-008, B-004, B-005','D-0002, D-0019, D-0017, D-0004, D-0005','FR-002, FR-003, FR-006, FR-007','An existing task is available for editing.','The user edits its due date.','The user opens the existing task editor.','2. The user selects another date or clears the date.\n  3. Valid changes follow existing autosave and update the task list.','An invalid draft preserves the last valid saved date. Cancel discards only unsaved or invalid draft changes; previously autosaved changes remain saved.','The valid new date or absence of date is saved; cancellation does not undo saved changes.'),('View overdue state and complete or reopen','B-002, B-009, B-010','D-0002, D-0016, D-0018','FR-001, FR-004, FR-005','Tasks are available in the list, with or without dates.','The user views tasks or changes completion state.','The application shows assigned dates and identifies unfinished tasks dated before local today as Overdue.','2. The user completes a task; the date remains and overdue emphasis disappears.\n  3. The user reopens it; overdue indication returns when applicable.','Today and future dates do not cause overdue status. Undated tasks remain supported. Existing ordering does not change.','Dates and completion-related presentation reflect the current task state without changing ordering.')]
