('Change an existing date','B-002, B-011','D-0002, D-0019','FR-002','An existing task has a saved due date.','The user selects another valid date and existing autosave completes.','The new date replaces the old date and is shown in the list.'),
('Clear an existing date','B-002, B-011','D-0002, D-0019','FR-002','A task has a saved due date.','The user clears it and existing autosave completes.','The date is removed; the task remains usable without a date and has no overdue indication.'),
