('Past unfinished task is overdue','B-009','D-0016','FR-004','An unfinished task has a due date earlier than device-local today.','The user views the task list.','The task shows an explicit Overdue label and subtle warning styling without changing task ordering.'),
('Today, future and undated tasks are not overdue','B-009','D-0016','FR-004','Unfinished tasks have dates equal to today, after today, or no due date.','The user views the task list.','None of these tasks shows overdue emphasis; ordering remains unchanged.'),
('Complete and reopen a dated task','B-010','D-0018','FR-005','An unfinished dated task is overdue.','The user completes it and later reopens it.','Completion retains the date and removes overdue emphasis; reopening restores it if the date is still before local today.'),
('Cancel unsaved draft retains saved changes','B-011','D-0019','FR-002','A date change has already autosaved and the user then makes an unsaved or invalid date draft.','The user cancels the draft.','Only that draft is discarded; the most recently autosaved date or saved cleared state remains.'),
